      "description": {
        "es": "Si se duerme, tardará la mitad de tiempo en despertarse.",
        "en": "This Pokémon's remaining sleep turn count falls by 2 rather than 1.\n\nIf this Pokémon's sleep counter is at 1, it will fall to 0 and then the Pokémon will wake up."
